  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Pipeline",
      "items": [
        "streamQuery(): SQL delta (janela horária, America/Sao_Paulo) na view dw-onfly-prd.service.temp_to_zenddesk_users",
        "mapRow() → ZendeskMapper::toUser() → ZendeskUserDTO (role end-user salvo @onfly.com.br, tags VIP, loyalty fields)",
        "buildDto(): org via resolvedOrgsCache → organizations_mapping; sem mapping → fallback upsertOrganization via BigQuery",
        "Batches ≤100 → Parallel (concurrency_users) → createOrUpdateManyUsers → pollJobStatus → reconcílio registro a registro"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Rate limit (Zendesk)",
      "items": [
        "throttleRequest(): mínimo 600ms entre requisições (~100 req/min)",
        "requestWithRetry(): MAX_ATTEMPTS=3; Connect/Server → backoff 2^n (1/2/4s)",
        "429 → Retry-After; esgotado → TransientZendeskException; outros 4xx → PermanentValidationException",
        "pollJobStatus(): backoff 2/5/10/30s, timeout 300s (ZENDESK_JOB_POLL_TIMEOUT_S); failed/killed → TransientZendeskException",
        "esperas via Coroutine::sleep() — não bloqueiam worker Swoole"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Dedup, resume e estado (MySQL)",
      "items": [
        "useDeduplication() = false: dedup Redis (sha256, TTL 30d) off para users",
        "Resume: ZendeskUserSyncLog (status=Success, synced_at = hoje) → skipped_resume",
        "organizations_mapping: company_id → zendesk_organization_id",
        "Falhas por stage: missing_id, batch_failure, per_record, unmatched_result"
      ]
    }
  ]
